<title>USA: Alexander &amp; Baldwin sets buyback.</title>
<headline>Alexander &amp; Baldwin sets buyback.</headline>
<dateline>HONOLULU 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alexander &amp; Baldwin Inc Thursday said its board of directors authorized the repurchase of up to three million additional shares of common stock.</p>
<p>This authorization replaces an expiring program, under which the company repurchased 1,283,934 shares.</p>
<p>The company said with approximately 45.3 million shares presently outstanding, this new authorization covers up to 6.6 percent of the shares.</p>
